# From googlebook-triage.tsv group 1: no visible effect in AOSP 17 (C): DragPositioningCallbackUtility reports the size-constraint violation, but ResizeTaskPositioner discards it and the cursor stays a resize arrow (type 1017 on both builds); harmless, kept for when the cursor code lands
flag_value {
  package: "com.android.window.flags"
  name: "enable_no_resize_cursor"
  state: ENABLED
  permission: READ_ONLY
}
